<title>UK: SOCCER-VILLA CAPTAIN TOWNSEND SIDELINED.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VILLA CAPTAIN TOWNSEND SIDELINED.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish international captain Andy Townsend is unlikely to be available to help Aston Villa's bid to challenge the English premier league leaders during February.</p>
<p>Townsend suffered a shoulder injury in Saturday's F.A. Cup defeat at Derby and manager Brian Little is not optimistic about a swift recovery.</p>
<p>&quot;We will have a better indication of the extent of the damage when Andy has seen a specialist, but I would suggest we are looking at him being out for a few weeks,&quot; said Little.</p>
</text>
